[{"n": "01", "title": "UMANG — running India's national super-app", "html": "<article class=\"case reveal\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"case-index\">CASE 01</div>\n              <h3>UMANG — running India's national super-app</h3>\n              <div class=\"context\"><strong>Digital India Corporation · NeGD (MeitY)</strong> — Senior DevOps Engineer, Nov 2025 – present</div>\n              <p><strong>The brief:</strong> own the AWS platform behind UMANG — the national super-app for citizen services at <strong>8–10 crore monthly users</strong> — alongside DevOps delivery for NITI Aayog flagships UPMS, NITI For States, and NGO Darpan (HLD/LLD, deployments, CI/CD).</p>\n              <h4>What was done</h4>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Sustained <strong>99.95% availability</strong> across two release trains with <strong>zero Sev-1 incidents</strong> on a hybrid EKS + ECS estate, multi-AZ Envoy ingress, KEDA-driven autoscaling, and SLO / error-budget release gates.</li>\n                <li>Led the <strong>lift-and-shift of MyScheme into UMANG</strong> — environment parity, secure VPC peering, CI/CD wiring, FinOps-driven cost optimization, and production cutover with <strong>zero user-facing downtime</strong>.</li>\n                <li>Cut <strong>MTTR from ~90 minutes to under 20 minutes</strong> across 40+ microservices — including integrations with EPFO, DigiYatra, DigiLocker and NSSO — by standardizing OpenTelemetry instrumentation and shared SRE runbooks.</li>\n              </ul>\n              <div class=\"chips\">\n                <span class=\"chip\">AWS</span><span class=\"chip\">EKS + ECS</span><span class=\"chip\">Envoy</span>\n                <span class=\"chip\">KEDA</span><span class=\"chip\">Terraform</span><span class=\"chip\">ArgoCD</span>\n                <span class=\"chip\">OpenTelemetry</span><span class=\"chip\">Prometheus</span><span class=\"chip\">Grafana</span>\n                <span class=\"chip\">SLO / Error budgets</span><span class=\"chip\">FinOps</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"case-visual\">\n              <div class=\"metric-row\">\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">100M</div><div class=\"l\">monthly active users</div></div>\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">99.95%</div><div class=\"l\">availability, 0 Sev-1</div></div>\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\"><em>−</em>78%</div><div class=\"l\">MTTR: 90 → &lt;20 min</div></div>\n              </div>\n              <figure class=\"diagram\" style=\"margin:0\">\n                <svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"UMANG platform architecture: users, multi-AZ Envoy ingress, EKS and ECS services on KEDA autoscaling, OpenTelemetry observability with SLO and error budget gates\">>\n                  <defs>\n                    <marker id=\"ah1\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--soft)\"/></marker>\n                    <marker id=\"ah1a\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n                  </defs>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"8\" y=\"86\" width=\"110\" height=\"64\" />\n                  <text x=\"63\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\">users</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"63\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\">up to 100M MAU</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"150\" y=\"86\" width=\"130\" height=\"64\" />\n                  <text x=\"215\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Envoy ingress</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"215\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\">multi-AZ</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box-hl\" x=\"312\" y=\"60\" width=\"200\" height=\"116\" />\n                  <text x=\"412\" y=\"88\" text-anchor=\"middle\">EKS + ECS services</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"412\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"middle\">40+ microservices</text>\n                  <text class=\"sub\" x=\"412\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">KEDA autoscaling</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"412\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">SLO · error-budget gates</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"150\" y=\"182\" width=\"202\" height=\"48\" />\n                  <text x=\"251\" y=\"201\" text-anchor=\"middle\">OpenTelemetry →</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"251\" y=\"219\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Prometheus · Grafana · runbooks</text>\n                  <path class=\"edge\" d=\"M118,118 H146\" marker-end=\"url(#ah1)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge\" d=\"M280,118 H308\" marker-end=\"url(#ah1)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge-hl\" d=\"M412,176 V206 H354\" marker-end=\"url(#ah1a)\"/>\n                </svg>\n                <figcaption>Request path → platform core → observability loop. Release gates are driven by measured SLOs, not ceremony.</figcaption>\n              </figure>\n            </div>\n          </article>"}, {"n": "02", "title": "Zero-downtime AWS migration for regulated fintech", "html": "<article class=\"case reveal\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"case-index\">CASE 02</div>\n              <h3>Zero-downtime AWS migration for regulated fintech</h3>\n              <div class=\"context\"><strong>Creditech Solutions (AlphaMoney)</strong> — Lead DevOps &amp; MLOps Engineer, Feb 2024 – Aug 2025</div>\n              <p><strong>The brief:</strong> migrate a regulated fintech workload on AWS — a domain where downtime means compliance risk — and modernize the platform's cost base without touching customer experience.</p>\n              <h4>What was done</h4>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Delivered a <strong>zero-downtime migration</strong> — zero customer-impacting minutes, <strong>99.9% post-migration SLO</strong> — via <strong>active-active EKS with Route 53 weighted traffic shifts</strong> and Terraform-managed landing zones.</li>\n                <li>Cut <strong>infrastructure cost by 30% while doubling traffic capacity</strong>: replaced manual provisioning with reusable Terraform modules, Karpenter-driven node consolidation, and right-sized RDS PostgreSQL tiers.</li>\n                <li>Extended platform and DevOps practices across parent-group ventures — <strong>AlphaCorp and Alpha Design Studio</strong> — delivering cloud-hosted ERP and a secure corporate intranet that standardized infrastructure across three sister organizations.</li>\n              </ul>\n              <div class=\"chips\">\n                <span class=\"chip\">AWS</span><span class=\"chip\">EKS active-active</span><span class=\"chip\">Route 53</span>\n                <span class=\"chip\">Terraform</span><span class=\"chip\">Karpenter</span><span class=\"chip\">RDS PostgreSQL</span>\n                <span class=\"chip\">GitHub Actions</span><span class=\"chip\">FinOps</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"case-visual\">\n              <div class=\"metric-row\">\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">0</div><div class=\"l\">customer-impacting minutes</div></div>\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">99.9%</div><div class=\"l\">post-migration SLO</div></div>\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\"><em>−</em>30%</div><div class=\"l\">cost · 2× traffic capacity</div></div>\n              </div>\n              <figure class=\"diagram\" style=\"margin:0\">\n                <svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Active-active EKS migration with Route 53 weighted traffic shifts, Terraform landing zones and right-sized RDS\">\n                  <defs>\n                    <marker id=\"ah2\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--soft)\"/></marker>\n                    <marker id=\"ah2a\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n                  </defs>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"8\" y=\"96\" width=\"110\" height=\"58\" />\n                  <text x=\"63\" y=\"121\" text-anchor=\"middle\">users</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"63\" y=\"139\" text-anchor=\"middle\">regulated fintech</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"150\" y=\"96\" width=\"136\" height=\"58\" />\n                  <text x=\"218\" y=\"121\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Route 53</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"218\" y=\"139\" text-anchor=\"middle\">weighted shifts</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box-hl\" x=\"318\" y=\"38\" width=\"194\" height=\"62\" />\n                  <text x=\"415\" y=\"63\" text-anchor=\"middle\">EKS · stack A</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"415\" y=\"81\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">active</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box-hl\" x=\"318\" y=\"118\" width=\"194\" height=\"62\" />\n                  <text x=\"415\" y=\"143\" text-anchor=\"middle\">EKS · stack B</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"415\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">active</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"150\" y=\"182\" width=\"160\" height=\"56\" />\n                  <text x=\"230\" y=\"205\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Terraform landing zones</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"230\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Karpenter · RDS right-sized</text>\n                  <path class=\"edge\" d=\"M118,125 H146\" marker-end=\"url(#ah2)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge\" d=\"M286,110 C300,110 302,69 314,69\" marker-end=\"url(#ah2)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge\" d=\"M286,140 C300,140 302,149 314,149\" marker-end=\"url(#ah2)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge\" d=\"M230,180 V156\" />\n                  <text class=\"label\" x=\"238\" y=\"168\">drives</text>\n                </svg>\n                <figcaption>Active–active EKS with weighted Route 53 shifts — traffic moved gradually, customer impact stayed at zero.</figcaption>\n              </figure>\n            </div>\n          </article>"}, {"n": "03", "title": "MLOps in production: Bank Statement Analyzer", "html": "<article class=\"case reveal\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"case-index\">CASE 03</div>\n              <h3>MLOps in production: Bank Statement Analyzer</h3>\n              <div class=\"context\"><strong>Creditech Solutions (AlphaMoney)</strong> — Lead DevOps &amp; MLOps Engineer</div>\n              <p><strong>The brief:</strong> ship a production ML system that ingests and classifies bank statements for credit decisioning — a pipeline that had to be reliable, observable, and cheap to operate day after day.</p>\n              <h4>What was done</h4>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Shipped a <strong>production Bank Statement Analyzer</strong> ingesting and classifying <strong>thousands of statements daily</strong> — a <strong>FastAPI inference service</strong> backed by <strong>Airflow-orchestrated ETL and feature pipelines</strong>, an <strong>MLflow model registry</strong>, and Kubernetes-native autoscaling.</li>\n                <li>Designed for MLOps maturity: versioned models in a registry, reproducible feature pipelines, and inference that scales with demand instead of sitting over-provisioned.</li>\n                <li>Applied the same discipline on consulting mandates — GPU workload orchestration and AI/ML CI/CD for Aftershoot, and an 8-week <strong>Kubeflow + MLflow real-time &amp; batch inference HLD/LLD</strong> for ZS Associates.</li>\n              </ul>\n              <div class=\"chips\">\n                <span class=\"chip\">FastAPI</span><span class=\"chip\">MLflow</span><span class=\"chip\">Kubeflow</span>\n                <span class=\"chip\">Airflow</span><span class=\"chip\">Kubernetes</span><span class=\"chip\">Vector DB</span>\n                <span class=\"chip\">Python</span><span class=\"chip\">GPU orchestration</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"case-visual\">\n              <div class=\"metric-row\">\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">1000s</div><div class=\"l\">statements classified daily</div></div>\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">8 wks</div><div class=\"l\">ZS inference HLD/LLD delivered</div></div>\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">Prod</div><div class=\"l\">not a prototype — live credit pipeline</div></div>\n              </div>\n              <figure class=\"diagram\" style=\"margin:0\">\n                <svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"MLOps pipeline: raw statements through Airflow ETL, MLflow registry, FastAPI inference on Kubernetes, to credit decisions\">\n                  <defs>\n                    <marker id=\"ah3\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n                  </defs>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"8\" y=\"52\" width=\"96\" height=\"58\" />\n                  <text x=\"56\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"middle\">raw</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"56\" y=\"95\" text-anchor=\"middle\">statements</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"132\" y=\"52\" width=\"120\" height=\"58\" />\n                  <text x=\"192\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Airflow</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"192\" y=\"95\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ETL + features</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"280\" y=\"52\" width=\"110\" height=\"58\" />\n                  <text x=\"335\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"middle\">MLflow</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"335\" y=\"95\" text-anchor=\"middle\">model registry</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box-hl\" x=\"132\" y=\"140\" width=\"258\" height=\"70\" />\n                  <text x=\"261\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\">FastAPI inference · Kubernetes</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"261\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">autoscaled · thousands/day</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"418\" y=\"140\" width=\"94\" height=\"70\" />\n                  <text x=\"465\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\">credit</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"465\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\">decisions</text>\n                  <path class=\"edge-hl\" d=\"M104,81 H128\" marker-end=\"url(#ah3)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge-hl\" d=\"M252,81 H276\" marker-end=\"url(#ah3)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge-hl\" d=\"M335,110 V136\" marker-end=\"url(#ah3)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge-hl\" d=\"M390,175 H414\" marker-end=\"url(#ah3)\"/>\n                </svg>\n                <figcaption>Feature pipelines stay reproducible, models stay versioned, inference scales with demand.</figcaption>\n              </figure>\n            </div>\n          </article>"}, {"n": "04", "title": "Azure → GCP re-platforming, finished early", "html": "<article class=\"case reveal\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"case-index\">CASE 04</div>\n              <h3>Azure → GCP re-platforming, finished early</h3>\n              <div class=\"context\"><strong>Smartvizx</strong> — DevOps Architect, Jul–Dec 2023 · migration-specific engagement</div>\n              <p><strong>The brief:</strong> re-platform a production Azure estate onto Google Cloud — full parity, zero data loss — and come out the other side faster than before.</p>\n              <h4>What was done</h4>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Closed the <strong>Azure → GCP migration ahead of deadline</strong> with <strong>zero data loss and 100% endpoint parity</strong>: workloads re-platformed on <strong>GKE</strong>, pipelines rebuilt on <strong>Cloud Build</strong>, and keyless service auth via <strong>Workload Identity</strong>.</li>\n                <li>Improved <strong>p95 latency by ~35%</strong> by introducing the <strong>Istio service mesh</strong> — mTLS, per-route retry/timeout policies, and deliberate traffic shaping.</li>\n                <li>Left no key-management debt: no long-lived credentials, no snowflake environments.</li>\n              </ul>\n              <div class=\"chips\">\n                <span class=\"chip\">Azure → GCP</span><span class=\"chip\">GKE</span><span class=\"chip\">Cloud Build</span>\n                <span class=\"chip\">Workload Identity</span><span class=\"chip\">Istio</span><span class=\"chip\">mTLS</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"case-visual\">\n              <div class=\"metric-row\">\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">0 bytes</div><div class=\"l\">data loss, 100% parity</div></div>\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\"><em>−</em>35%</div><div class=\"l\">p95 latency via Istio</div></div>\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">Early</div><div class=\"l\">deadline beaten</div></div>\n              </div>\n              <figure class=\"diagram\" style=\"margin:0\">\n                <svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Azure to GCP migration: Cloud Build pipelines to GKE with Workload Identity keyless auth, Istio mesh for traffic shaping and mTLS\">\n                  <defs>\n                    <marker id=\"ah4\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--soft)\"/></marker>\n                    <marker id=\"ah4a\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n                  </defs>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"8\" y=\"96\" width=\"96\" height=\"58\" />\n                  <text x=\"56\" y=\"121\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Azure</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"56\" y=\"139\" text-anchor=\"middle\">legacy estate</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"132\" y=\"96\" width=\"120\" height=\"58\" />\n                  <text x=\"192\" y=\"121\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Cloud Build</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"192\" y=\"139\" text-anchor=\"middle\">pipelines</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box-hl\" x=\"280\" y=\"72\" width=\"232\" height=\"106\" />\n                  <text x=\"396\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\">GKE platform</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"396\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">Workload Identity · keyless</text>\n                  <text class=\"sub\" x=\"396\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Istio mesh · mTLS · retries</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"396\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">p95 latency −35%</text>\n                  <path class=\"edge-hl\" d=\"M104,125 H128\" marker-end=\"url(#ah4a)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge-hl\" d=\"M252,125 H276\" marker-end=\"url(#ah4a)\"/>\n                </svg>\n                <figcaption>GKE re-platform with keyless auth from day one; the mesh paid for itself in latency.</figcaption>\n              </figure>\n            </div>\n          </article>"}, {"n": "05", "title": "Azzy Agents — a self-hosted AI agent platform", "html": "<article class=\"case reveal\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"case-index\">CASE 05</div>\n              <h3>Azzy Agents — a self-hosted AI agent platform</h3>\n              <div class=\"context\"><strong>Sarvnex Technologies</strong> — independent build: designed, built, set up &amp; operated end-to-end</div>\n              <p><strong>The brief:</strong> build a personal AI agent platform that is genuinely model-agnostic — agents that keep working when any single model provider is down, rate-limited, or repriced — without handing the keys to a third-party AI SaaS.</p>\n              <h4>What was done</h4>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Architected the platform on <strong>Docker Compose</strong> (EC2): agent API and workers sit behind an <strong>LLM gateway (OmniRoute)</strong> with provider abstraction and <strong>automatic failover across models</strong> — no single-vendor dependency anywhere in the chain.</li>\n                <li>Kept the intelligence local where it matters: a <strong>fully self-hosted embeddings pipeline</strong> for retrieval, with LLM traffic routed through a cost-optimised fallback chain — inference runs at near-zero marginal cost while staying swappable.</li>\n                <li>Operated like a production service, not a demo: TLS, health checks, backups, and a written <strong>audit of the platform's cost, reliability and certificate posture</strong>.</li>\n              </ul>\n              <div class=\"chips\">\n                <span class=\"chip\">AI Agents</span><span class=\"chip\">LLM Gateway</span><span class=\"chip\">Multi-model routing</span>\n                <span class=\"chip\">Local embeddings</span><span class=\"chip\">Docker Compose</span><span class=\"chip\">Python</span>\n                <span class=\"chip\">AWS EC2</span><span class=\"chip\">TLS</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"case-visual\">\n              <div class=\"metric-row\">\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">24×7</div><div class=\"l\">agents live in production</div></div>\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">Multi-LLM</div><div class=\"l\">gateway with automatic failover</div></div>\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">Local</div><div class=\"l\">embeddings — no external vector API</div></div>\n              </div>\n              <figure class=\"diagram\" style=\"margin:0\">\n                <svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Azzy Agents architecture: agent API and workers behind an LLM gateway with failover across model providers, and a local embeddings pipeline\">\n                  <defs>\n                    <marker id=\"ah5\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--soft)\"/></marker>\n                    <marker id=\"ah5a\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n                  </defs>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"8\" y=\"86\" width=\"110\" height=\"64\" />\n                  <text x=\"63\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\">agent API</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"63\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\">+ workers</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box-hl\" x=\"150\" y=\"86\" width=\"140\" height=\"64\" />\n                  <text x=\"220\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\">LLM gateway</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"220\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">routing · failover</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"322\" y=\"38\" width=\"190\" height=\"56\" />\n                  <text x=\"417\" y=\"61\" text-anchor=\"middle\">model providers</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"417\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"middle\">swappable · no lock-in</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"322\" y=\"118\" width=\"190\" height=\"56\" />\n                  <text x=\"417\" y=\"141\" text-anchor=\"middle\">fallback chain</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"417\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"middle\">cost-optimised</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"150\" y=\"182\" width=\"202\" height=\"48\" />\n                  <text x=\"251\" y=\"201\" text-anchor=\"middle\">local embeddings</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"251\" y=\"219\" text-anchor=\"middle\">self-hosted retrieval</text>\n                  <path class=\"edge\" d=\"M118,118 H146\" marker-end=\"url(#ah5)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge-hl\" d=\"M290,100 C304,100 306,66 318,66\" marker-end=\"url(#ah5a)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge-hl\" d=\"M290,136 C304,136 306,146 318,146\" marker-end=\"url(#ah5a)\"/>\n                </svg>\n                <figcaption>One gateway, many models: providers are interchangeable parts, not dependencies.</figcaption>\n              </figure>\n            </div>\n          </article>"}, {"n": "06", "title": "PBM Portal — Ministry of Finance, staging to production", "html": "<article class=\"case reveal\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"case-index\">CASE 06</div>\n              <h3>PBM Portal — Ministry of Finance, staging to production</h3>\n              <div class=\"context\"><strong>NeGD (MeitY) · Ministry of Finance programme</strong> — Senior DevOps Engineer</div>\n              <p><strong>The brief:</strong> own DevOps for the PBM programme-management portal end-to-end — staging operations day to day, and a full production go-live on the ministry's secured on-premise network.</p>\n              <h4>What was done</h4>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Run <strong>staging + production</strong> end-to-end: Dockerized <strong>NestJS backend + Angular frontend</strong> behind Apache, PostgreSQL, scripted deployments with <strong>pre-deploy database backups</strong> and post-deploy seed/permission verification on every release.</li>\n                <li>Took the portal <strong>live in production on the ministry's on-prem network</strong> — frontend, backend, database and an AI service wired across the LAN under Sectigo TLS — with <strong>automated weekly backups</strong> of files and both databases to S3-compatible storage.</li>\n                <li>Shipped an <strong>AI service (LLM + embeddings)</strong> for proposal summaries, including a <strong>bulk-summary API</strong> (up to 100 proposals per job with progress tracking), and closed <strong>VAPT/SAST</strong> findings through audited rounds — RSA-OAEP password encryption, OTP hardening, permission-model fixes.</li>\n              </ul>\n              <div class=\"chips\">\n                <span class=\"chip\">Docker</span><span class=\"chip\">NestJS</span><span class=\"chip\">Angular</span>\n                <span class=\"chip\">PostgreSQL</span><span class=\"chip\">Apache</span><span class=\"chip\">FastAPI</span>\n                <span class=\"chip\">LLM APIs</span><span class=\"chip\">Embeddings</span><span class=\"chip\">S3</span>\n                <span class=\"chip\">VAPT / SAST</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"case-visual\">\n              <div class=\"metric-row\">\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">2</div><div class=\"l\">environments: staging + production</div></div>\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">100</div><div class=\"l\">proposals per bulk AI summary job</div></div>\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">Weekly</div><div class=\"l\">automated backups, 4-week retention</div></div>\n              </div>\n              <figure class=\"diagram\" style=\"margin:0\">\n                <svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"PBM Portal production architecture: Apache frontend to NestJS backend and PostgreSQL, with a FastAPI AI service for proposal summaries and weekly backups to S3 storage\">\n                  <defs>\n                    <marker id=\"ah6\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--soft)\"/></marker>\n                    <marker id=\"ah6a\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n                  </defs>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"8\" y=\"60\" width=\"110\" height=\"58\" />\n                  <text x=\"63\" y=\"84\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Angular FE</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"63\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Apache · TLS</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box-hl\" x=\"150\" y=\"60\" width=\"140\" height=\"58\" />\n                  <text x=\"220\" y=\"84\" text-anchor=\"middle\">NestJS backend</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"220\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">Docker · scripted deploys</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"322\" y=\"60\" width=\"190\" height=\"58\" />\n                  <text x=\"417\" y=\"84\" text-anchor=\"middle\">PostgreSQL</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"417\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\">portal + AI databases</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"150\" y=\"146\" width=\"140\" height=\"58\" />\n                  <text x=\"220\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AI service</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"220\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"middle\">LLM summaries · bulk API</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"322\" y=\"146\" width=\"190\" height=\"58\" />\n                  <text x=\"417\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\">S3 storage</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"417\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"middle\">weekly backups</text>\n                  <path class=\"edge\" d=\"M118,89 H146\" marker-end=\"url(#ah6)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge\" d=\"M290,89 H318\" marker-end=\"url(#ah6)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge-hl\" d=\"M220,118 V142\" marker-end=\"url(#ah6a)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge\" d=\"M290,175 H318\" marker-end=\"url(#ah6)\"/>\n                </svg>\n                <figcaption>Staging discipline, production stakes: every release backed up, seeded and verified.</figcaption>\n              </figure>\n            </div>\n          </article>"}, {"n": "07", "title": "Umangverse — the immersive UMANG experience", "html": "<article class=\"case reveal\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"case-index\">CASE 07</div>\n              <h3>Umangverse — the immersive UMANG experience</h3>\n              <div class=\"context\"><strong>NeGD (MeitY) · UMANG ecosystem</strong> — designed, built &amp; set up end-to-end</div>\n              <p><strong>The brief:</strong> design and build Umangverse — the immersive web experience in the UMANG ecosystem — and own its platform end-to-end: deployment, hardening and security assurance to the same standard as the core platform.</p>\n              <h4>What was done</h4>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Built the experience end-to-end (<strong>Vite + TypeScript</strong>, served by nginx) and deployed it as a <strong>containerized service behind a reverse proxy with TLS</strong> on NeGD infrastructure — the application listens on loopback only; the proxy is the single public face.</li>\n                <li>Delivered a <strong>full SAST review</strong> of the codebase — a findings report with severity ratings and remediation guidance the team could act on directly.</li>\n                <li>Took the experience to its <strong>v2.0 release</strong> under the same release discipline as the core UMANG platform.</li>\n              </ul>\n              <div class=\"chips\">\n                <span class=\"chip\">Docker</span><span class=\"chip\">Reverse proxy</span><span class=\"chip\">TLS</span>\n                <span class=\"chip\">SAST</span><span class=\"chip\">Linux</span><span class=\"chip\">Web security</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"case-visual\">\n              <div class=\"metric-row\">\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">v2.0</div><div class=\"l\">live release</div></div>\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">SAST</div><div class=\"l\">full security review delivered</div></div>\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">1</div><div class=\"l\">public face — proxy-only exposure</div></div>\n              </div>\n              <figure class=\"diagram\" style=\"margin:0\">\n                <svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Umangverse deployment: public traffic reaches only the TLS reverse proxy, which fronts the containerized Umangverse service on loopback\">\n                  <defs>\n                    <marker id=\"ah7\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--soft)\"/></marker>\n                    <marker id=\"ah7a\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n                  </defs>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"8\" y=\"86\" width=\"110\" height=\"64\" />\n                  <text x=\"63\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\">visitors</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"63\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\">UMANG ecosystem</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"150\" y=\"86\" width=\"130\" height=\"64\" />\n                  <text x=\"215\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\">reverse proxy</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"215\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\">TLS · only public face</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box-hl\" x=\"312\" y=\"86\" width=\"200\" height=\"64\" />\n                  <text x=\"412\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Umangverse container</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"412\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">loopback-only · SAST-reviewed</text>\n                  <path class=\"edge\" d=\"M118,118 H146\" marker-end=\"url(#ah7)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge-hl\" d=\"M280,118 H308\" marker-end=\"url(#ah7a)\"/>\n                </svg>\n                <figcaption>Minimal public surface by design — one proxy, one container, zero direct exposure.</figcaption>\n              </figure>\n            </div>\n          </article>"}, {"n": "08", "title": "Government production fleet — NFS, UPMS &amp; beyond", "html": "<article class=\"case reveal\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"case-index\">CASE 08</div>\n              <h3>Government production fleet — NFS, UPMS &amp; beyond</h3>\n              <div class=\"context\"><strong>NeGD (MeitY)</strong> — production operations across programmes</div>\n              <p><strong>The brief:</strong> beyond UMANG, run production for a fleet of government platforms — <strong>NFS (NITI Aayog) on GCP</strong>, <strong>UPMS on AWS</strong>, MoSPI staging estates and a <strong>20-microservice hospital platform (HMS)</strong> — under one secure access and release model.</p>\n              <h4>What was done</h4>\n              <ul>\n                <li><strong>NFS production (NITI Aayog, GCP):</strong> bastion-mediated production access and staged deployments — release v3.94 verified live with a full smoke suite — under strict session-hygiene rules for production shells.</li>\n                <li><strong>UPMS production (AWS):</strong> a dated-branch release workflow with pre-built images and rollback tags across backend, auth, admin and frontend services — deploys that can always be undone.</li>\n                <li><strong>One secure mesh:</strong> built a <strong>Tailscale network across 19 servers</strong> spanning AWS, GCP and on-premise estates, so production access no longer depends on brittle public-IP allowlists — and run HMS, a 20-microservice hospital system with hospital-wide Voice AI, on the same operating discipline.</li>\n              </ul>\n              <div class=\"chips\">\n                <span class=\"chip\">GCP</span><span class=\"chip\">AWS</span><span class=\"chip\">Tailscale</span>\n                <span class=\"chip\">Bastion hosts</span><span class=\"chip\">Docker</span><span class=\"chip\">Jenkins</span>\n                <span class=\"chip\">.NET microservices</span><span class=\"chip\">Voice AI</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"case-visual\">\n              <div class=\"metric-row\">\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">19</div><div class=\"l\">servers in one secure mesh</div></div>\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">3</div><div class=\"l\">networks: AWS · GCP · on-prem</div></div>\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">20</div><div class=\"l\">microservices on the HMS platform</div></div>\n              </div>\n              <figure class=\"diagram\" style=\"margin:0\">\n                <svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Production fleet: one operator reaching AWS, GCP and on-premise estates through a Tailscale mesh and bastion hosts\">\n                  <defs>\n                    <marker id=\"ah8\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--soft)\"/></marker>\n                    <marker id=\"ah8a\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n                  </defs>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"8\" y=\"86\" width=\"110\" height=\"64\" />\n                  <text x=\"63\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\">operator</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"63\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\">one access model</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box-hl\" x=\"150\" y=\"86\" width=\"140\" height=\"64\" />\n                  <text x=\"220\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Tailscale mesh</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"220\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">+ bastion hosts</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"322\" y=\"20\" width=\"190\" height=\"48\" />\n                  <text x=\"417\" y=\"41\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AWS</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"417\" y=\"57\" text-anchor=\"middle\">UPMS prod · HMS · MoSPI</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"322\" y=\"86\" width=\"190\" height=\"48\" />\n                  <text x=\"417\" y=\"107\" text-anchor=\"middle\">GCP</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"417\" y=\"123\" text-anchor=\"middle\">NFS prod (NITI Aayog)</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"322\" y=\"152\" width=\"190\" height=\"48\" />\n                  <text x=\"417\" y=\"173\" text-anchor=\"middle\">On-premise</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"417\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"middle\">PBM production (NGC)</text>\n                  <path class=\"edge\" d=\"M118,118 H146\" marker-end=\"url(#ah8)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge-hl\" d=\"M290,96 C304,96 306,44 318,44\" marker-end=\"url(#ah8a)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge-hl\" d=\"M290,110 H318\" marker-end=\"url(#ah8a)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge-hl\" d=\"M290,140 C304,140 306,176 318,176\" marker-end=\"url(#ah8a)\"/>\n                </svg>\n                <figcaption>Three networks, nineteen servers, one disciplined way in — and a rollback for every release.</figcaption>\n              </figure>\n            </div>\n          </article>"}, {"n": "09", "title": "HMS Voice AI — the doctor dictates, the system writes", "html": "<article class=\"case reveal\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"case-index\">CASE 09</div>\n              <h3>HMS Voice AI — the doctor dictates, the system writes</h3>\n              <div class=\"context\"><strong>NeGD (MeitY) · HMS hospital platform</strong> — Voice AI designed, built &amp; integrated by Shahrukh</div>\n              <p><strong>The use case:</strong> a doctor finishes a patient round and simply <em>speaks</em> — in the Hindi-English mix (Hinglish) she actually uses. Sixty seconds later a structured clinical note is on screen for her confirmation. No typing, no templates, no data leaving the hospital.</p>\n              <h4>The scenario, as implemented</h4>\n              <ul>\n                <li><strong>1 · Dictate</strong> — the doctor dictates from the browser voice panel: symptoms, vitals, diagnosis, medicines, advice — in Hindi, Hinglish or English.</li>\n                <li><strong>2 · Transcribe</strong> — LiveKit streams the audio (WebRTC); <strong>faster-whisper</strong> transcribes it on the hospital's own server.</li>\n                <li><strong>3 · Structure</strong> — <strong>MedGemma 4B</strong> (Google's medical LLM, self-hosted on Ollama) turns the transcript into a structured note — fields, doses and vitals in their right places.</li>\n                <li><strong>4 · Confirm</strong> — the doctor reviews and confirms on screen. <strong>Nothing is ever saved without clinician confirmation</strong> — the confirm-gate is architectural, not a setting.</li>\n                <li><strong>5 · Save &amp; speak back</strong> — the note saves through the existing HMS service APIs, and <strong>Kokoro TTS</strong> speaks the confirmation summary back to the doctor.</li>\n              </ul>\n              <h4>From POC to hospital-wide</h4>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Proved as an <strong>isolated POC</strong> alongside the live system — zero downtime, live data untouched — passing validation across EMR, OPD, Pathology, Radiology, Pharmacy, Billing, IPD and Discharge with <strong>100% field accuracy on Hinglish dictation</strong>.</li>\n                <li>Then <strong>integrated into every clinical module</strong> of the 20-microservice HMS — EMR doctor notes, IPD rounds and nurse notes, ICU, OT, radiology, pathology and discharge — behind the platform's JWT gateway.</li>\n                <li>Performance-tuned in production: note structuring went from <strong>~115 seconds to ~5 seconds</strong> (warm model, tuned inference); a 33-second dictation is review-ready in about a minute on CPU alone.</li>\n                <li>Every model is <strong>free and open-source, self-hosted</strong> — patient audio is processed inside the hospital's own servers and never leaves. POC cost: ₹0.</li>\n              </ul>\n              <div class=\"chips\">\n                <span class=\"chip\">Voice AI</span><span class=\"chip\">faster-whisper</span><span class=\"chip\">MedGemma</span>\n                <span class=\"chip\">Ollama</span><span class=\"chip\">LiveKit · WebRTC</span><span class=\"chip\">Kokoro TTS</span>\n                <span class=\"chip\">Docker</span><span class=\"chip\">.NET microservices</span><span class=\"chip\">YARP gateway</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"case-visual\">\n              <div class=\"metric-row\">\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">20</div><div class=\"l\">microservices on the HMS platform</div></div>\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">~5s</div><div class=\"l\">to structure a note — was ~115s</div></div>\n                <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"n\">0</div><div class=\"l\">patient audio leaves the hospital</div></div>\n              </div>\n              <figure class=\"diagram\" style=\"margin:0\">\n                <svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"HMS Voice AI flow: doctor dictates in Hinglish, LiveKit streams audio, Whisper transcribes, MedGemma structures the note, the doctor confirms, and the note saves via HMS APIs with a spoken confirmation\">\n                  <defs>\n                    <marker id=\"ah11\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--soft)\"/></marker>\n                    <marker id=\"ah11a\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n                  </defs>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"8\" y=\"30\" width=\"150\" height=\"58\" />\n                  <text x=\"83\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\">doctor dictates</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"83\" y=\"73\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hinglish · browser mic</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"186\" y=\"30\" width=\"150\" height=\"58\" />\n                  <text x=\"261\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\">faster-whisper</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"261\" y=\"73\" text-anchor=\"middle\">LiveKit stream · STT</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box-hl\" x=\"364\" y=\"30\" width=\"148\" height=\"58\" />\n                  <text x=\"438\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\">MedGemma 4B</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"438\" y=\"73\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">structured note · ~5s</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box-hl\" x=\"186\" y=\"130\" width=\"150\" height=\"58\" />\n                  <text x=\"261\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">doctor CONFIRMS</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"261\" y=\"173\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">nothing saves without it</text>\n                  <rect class=\"box\" x=\"364\" y=\"130\" width=\"148\" height=\"58\" />\n                  <text x=\"438\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">saved via HMS APIs</text><text class=\"sub\" x=\"438\" y=\"173\" text-anchor=\"middle\">+ spoken confirmation</text>\n                  <path class=\"edge\" d=\"M158,59 H182\" marker-end=\"url(#ah11)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge-hl\" d=\"M336,59 H360\" marker-end=\"url(#ah11a)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge-hl\" d=\"M438,88 V126\" marker-end=\"url(#ah11a)\"/>\n                  <path class=\"edge\" d=\"M336,159 H360\" marker-end=\"url(#ah11)\"/>\n                </svg>\n                <figcaption>Dictate → transcribe → structure → confirm → save. The full implemented architecture is below.</figcaption>\n              </figure>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"hld reveal\">\n              <span class=\"kicker no-bar mono\" style=\"font-size:11.5px;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:0.14em;\">IMPLEMENTED ARCHITECTURE — AS BUILT (POC SETUP, NOV 2026)</span>\n              <figure style=\"margin:12px 0 4px\">\n                <img src=\"hms-voice-ai-architecture.png\" alt=\"HMS Voice AI implemented architecture: three-server setup with the existing HMS platform and the additive, isolated Voice AI stack — LiveKit, faster-whisper, MedGemma on Ollama, Kokoro TTS and a separate POC database\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n                <figcaption style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;margin-top:8px\">The POC ran as an additive, isolated stack beside the live HMS — the same design that then integrated module-by-module into production. (Server addresses removed for the public portfolio.)</figcaption>\n              </figure>\n            </div>\n          </article>"}]